        }
      ],
      "returnType": "template<ResultType> void",
      "docs": "\\ingroup MatrixFunctions_Module\n\\brief Helper struct for computing matrix square roots of general matrices.\n\\tparam  MatrixType  type of the argument of the matrix square root,\nexpected to be an instantiation of the Matrix class template.\n\\sa MatrixSquareRootTriangular, MatrixSquareRootQuasiTriangular, MatrixBase::sqrt()"
    },
    {
      "id": "matrix-square-root-return-value",
      "name": "MatrixSquareRootReturnValue",
      "category": "MatrixSquareRoot",
      "signature": "MatrixSquareRootReturnValue(Src)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Src",
          "type": "Derived& src ) : m_src ("
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "\\ingroup MatrixFunctions_Module\n\\brief Proxy for the matrix square root of some matrix (expression).\n\\tparam Derived  Type of the argument to the matrix square root.\nThis class holds the argument to the matrix square root until it\nis assigned or evaluated for some other reason (so the argument\nshould not be changed in the meantime). It is the return type of\nMatrixBase::sqrt() and most of the time this is the only way it is\nused."
    },
